# docs/ is an Obsidian vault. It commits only what makes the vault the same
# from any checkout: which community plugins are on, BRAT's list (so BRAT
# installs review-md on a fresh clone) and review-md's reviewer name. Plugin
# code, window layout and caches stay local. Same layout as 3d-models/docs.
#
# BRAT's data.json has a token field. It is empty: BRAT 2.x keeps tokens in
# Obsidian's secret store instead. Never paste a token there; gitleaks would
# block the commit.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/app.json
!/community-plugins.json
!/plugins/
/plugins/*/*
!/plugins/obsidian42-brat/data.json
!/plugins/review-md/data.json
